| 3 || 4 || 5 || Game begins
|-
| 1 || 4 || 5 || Bob takes 2 from A
|-
| 1 || 4 || 2 || Alice takes 3 from C
|-
| 1 || 3 || 2 || Bob takes 1 from B
|-
| 1 || 2 || 2 || Alice takes 1 from B
|-
| 0 || 2 || 2 || Bob takes entire A heap, leaving two 2s
|-
| 0 || 1 || 2 || Alice takes 1 from B
