| 0 || 1 || 1 || Bob takes 1 from C leaving two 1s. (''In misère play he would take 2 from C leaving [0, 1, 0]'')
|-
| 0 || 0 || 1 || Alice takes 1 from B
|-
| 0 || 0 || 0 || Bob takes entire C heap and wins
|}

